'''Giyu Tomioka''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 15.1 Update#Version 15.1.1 Update|Version 15.1.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 844
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Giyu Tomioka
|name2 = Giyu Tomioka CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Giyu Tomioka CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Giyu Tomioka is a backline [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]]/[[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] DPS and crowd-control hybrid. He has great effective DPS and bulk via [[Strong Against]], a decent attack rate, and high range. He is even kitted out with a [[Slow]] that has over a 70% uptime on the third hit, truly the complete package.

Against [[:Category:Red Enemies|Reds]], he's strong enough to hold his own in pretty much any matchup one can think of: from [[Bore]] to [[Red EnerG]] to [[Doctor K.O.]], there's not much to worry about outside of [[Professor A.]], which is not too surprising. However, where Giyu Tomioka really shines is against [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]], whom he counters surprisingly well across the board; he deals excellent damage to [[R.Ost]]s, outranges [[Rain D.]]s and [[H. Nah]]s, tanks [[Camelle]]s, [[Master A.]]s, [[Kory|Kories]], [[THE SLOTH|SLOTHS]], and doesn't break a sweat doing it. He is extremely well-rounded as a result, and even has phenomenal immunities that help with [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]] like [[Kappy Jr.]] and [[Kappy Kawano]], or various stages of [[Heavenly Tower|Heavenly]]/[[Infernal Tower]].

